#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks could not create the mu-plugins folder. Please create the "
"following directory: %s"
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks nije mogao generirati mapu mu-plugins. Molimo kreirajte slijedeću "
"mapu: %s"

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks could not copy the autoloader from %1$s to %2$s. Please copy the "
"file manually."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks nije mogao kopirati autoloader iz %1$s u %2$s. Molimo da ga "
"kopirate ručno."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks will not work with your version of PHP. Pressbooks requires PHP "
"version %s or greater. Please upgrade PHP if you would like to use "
"Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks neće raditi sa vašom inačicom PHP-a. Za Pressbooks potrebna je "
"PHP inačica %s ili viša. Molimo nadogradite PHP u koliko želite koristiti "
"Pressbooks."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks will not work with your version of WordPress. Pressbooks requires "
"a dedicated install of WordPress Multisite, version %s or greater. Please "
"upgrade WordPress if you would like to use Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks neće raditi na Vašoj inačici Wordpressa. Pressbooks zahtjeva "
"dediciranu inačicu Wordpress Multisite, inačice %s ili više. Molimo "
"nadogradite Wordpress u koliko želite koristiti Pressbooks."

msgid ""
"The Pressbooks plugin is inactive, but you have active plugins that require "
"Pressbooks. This is causing errors. Please go to the Plugins page, and "
"activate Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks dodatak nije aktivan, ali imate aktivne dodatke koji zahtijevaju "
"Pressbooks. To uzrokuje greške pri radu. Molimo posjetite stranicu dodataka "
"i aktivirajte Pressbooks dodatak."

